ness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'It seems that true answer is: gold'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 50}, 'text': "I don't mind!"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 40, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'I am sorry to hear that. I am a little sad.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 30, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 45}, 'text': 'Why are you sad?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 5, 'Sadness': 50, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'I am sad. I am sad.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 50}, 'text': 'Oh there there. Do you like dancing?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 30, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 45}, 'text': 'I do but I do not dance much'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 50}, 'text': "Me too. There's never enough time for nice things in life."}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 50}, 'text': 'Maybe we could meet at the beach and do it'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 50}, 'text': 'That would be really great!'}}, {'role': 'participan