, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 50}, 'text': "yes i'm . i also design clothes . just opened my online shop in august"}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 65}, 'text': "That is cool. And I've buy a new car recently"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 60}, 'text': 'why do you want me to buy you a new car ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 65}, 'text': "I don't want you to buy a new car. But... I have a great variant for you..."}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 60}, 'text': 'you should get a bike too . but do not get a harley . how was your day ? 🙈'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 60}, 'text': "Great. I've cut my hair"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 65}, 'text': 'what shape is your face ? highlights are awesome .'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 75}, 'text': 'This is personal information'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 0, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 55}, 'text': 'yep , i make a lot of money , but donate a lot of it and time to charity .. Also, try to guess: i was poor ...'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'cont