?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'blue for the university of kentucky. hows it going today ?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'i am a vegan and i love hummus. do you like meat?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': "i'm a vegan too , awesome .. Also, try to guess: i turned 18 ..."}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'today'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 20, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'years old yesterday, funny you :)'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'happy birthday then!'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 20, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'thanks ! what do you do for a living ? 😅'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': "alot of things. not driving a car, not doing what i don't want to do etc and what about you?"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 30, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 20, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'i need a new car and i just want an orange car